creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 9; favorites: 7; remixes: 3.\nTags: pricing, section, css, plans, billing, conversion.\n## Overview\nAxiom Financial Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\n\nAxiom Products Integrations Customers Documentation Pricing Sign In Get API Keys Live Ledger Syncing Total Processed Volume $14,204,890.52 ERP Sync Treasury Tax Auth Financial infrastructure for the modern web Consolida…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Financial infrastructure for the modern web.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #10B981, secondary #34D399, accent #34D399, background #FFFFFF, surface #71717A, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Axiom Financial Infrastructure</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-zinc-950 text-zinc-50 min-h-screen flex flex-col font-sans overflow-hidden selection:bg-emerald-500/30\">\n\n    <!-- Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-6 md:px-12 py-6 z-20 relative w-full\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:wallet-money-linear\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"text-emerald-400\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n            <span class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-tight uppercase\">Axiom</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-xs font-normal text-zinc-400 tracking-wide\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-zinc-50 transition-colors\">Products</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-zinc-50 transition-colors\">Integrations</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-zinc-50 transition-colors\">Customers</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-zinc-50 transition-colors\">Documentation</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-zinc-50 transition-colors\">Pricing</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hidden sm:block px-4 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-300 hover:text-white transition-colors\">\n                Sign In\n            </a>\n            <!-- Button with subtle gradient border -->\n            <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500/50 to-cyan-500/50 shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(16,185,129,0.2)]\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"block px-5 py-2 bg-zinc-950 text-xs font-medium text-white hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors rounded-full\">\n                    Get API Keys\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Area -->\n    <main class=\"flex-grow relative flex flex-col justify-end pb-20 md:pb-32 z-10 w-full\">\n\n        <!-- Animation Canvas Container -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none\">\n            <canvas id=\"finance-canvas\" class=\"w-full h-full\"></canvas>\n\n            <!-- Central Ledger/Engine UI Card -->\n            <div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[320px] bg-zinc-900/80 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-2xl shadow-2xl z-10 border border-white/10 flex flex-col p-6\">\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center mb-4 border-b border-white/5 pb-4\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-normal text-zinc-400 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chart-square-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                        Live Ledger\n                    </span>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-400/10 px-2 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium\">\n                       <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                       Syncing\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"text-xs font-normal text-zinc-500 mb-1\">Total Processed Volume</div>\n                <div class=\"text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white mb-6\">$14,204,890.52</div>\n\n                <!-- Micro Activity Chart -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-end gap-1.5 h-12 w-full mt-auto\">\n                    <div class=\"w-full bg-zinc-700/50 rounded-t-[2px] h-[30%]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-full bg-zinc-700/50 rounded-t-[2px] h-[45%]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-full bg-zinc-700/50 rounded-t-[2px] h-[25%]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-full bg-emerald-500/40 rounded-t-[2px] h-[60%]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-full bg-emerald-500/70 rounded-t-[2px] h-[85%]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-full bg-emerald-400 rounded-t-[2px] h-full shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(52,211,153,0.5)]\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Floating Output Nodes -->\n            <div class=\"absolute z-20 w-32 h-10 bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-700/60 rounded-lg shadow-xl flex items-center px-3 gap-2\" style=\"left: calc(50% + 220px); top: calc(50% - 80px); transform: translateY(-50%);\">\n                <div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded bg-blue-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-400\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-square-linear\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"text-zinc-300 text-xs font-medium tracking-tight\">ERP Sync</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"absolute z-20 w-32 h-10 bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-700/60 rounded-lg shadow-xl flex items-center px-3 gap-2\" style=\"left: calc(50% + 260px); top: calc(50%); transform: translateY(-50%);\">\n                <div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded bg-amber-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:safe-square-linear\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"text-zinc-300 text-xs font-medium tracking-tight\">Treasury</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"absolute z-20 w-32 h-10 bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-700/60 rounded-lg shadow-xl flex items-center px-3 gap-2\" style=\"left: calc(50% + 200px); top: calc(50% + 80px); transform: translateY(-50%);\">\n                <div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded bg-purple-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-purple-400\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:document-text-linear\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"text-zinc-300 text-xs font-medium tracking-tight\">Tax Auth</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Headline & Copy -->\n        <div class=\"px-6 md:px-12 z-20 relative max-w-3xl\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-medium tracking-tight leading-[1.05] text-white\">\n                <span class=\"text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-zinc-100 to-zinc-500\">Financial infrastructure</span><br />\n                for the modern web\n            </h1>\n            <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm md:text-base text-zinc-400 font-normal leading-relaxed max-w-xl\">\n                Consolidate banking data, automate multi-currency reconciliation, and stream real-time ledger updates across your entire organization with a single unified API.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"mt-8 flex items-center gap-4\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-5 py-2.5 bg-white text-zinc-950 text-xs font-medium tracking-wide rounded-full hover:bg-zinc-200 transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-white/10\">\n                    Explore Platform\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-5 py-2.5 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-300 hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    Read the Docs <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Canvas Animation Script -->\n    <script>\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('finance-canvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d', { alpha: true });\n        let width, height;\n\n        function resize() {\n            width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n            height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n        }\n        window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n        resize();\n\n        // Transaction data streams configuration\n        const colors = ['#10b981', '#34d399', '#3b82f6', '#0ea5e9', '#71717a'];\n        const numLines = 60;\n        const lines = Array.from({ length: numLines }, () => createLine(true));\n\n        function createLine(randomX = false) {\n            return {\n                x: randomX ? Math.random() * -width : -200,\n                length: Math.random() * 80 + 30,\n                speed: Math.random() * 5 + 3,\n                color: colors[Math.floor(Math.random() * colors.length)],\n                thickness: Math.random() > 0.8 ? 3 : 1.5,\n                offsetY: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 200 // Spread vertically to hit the ledger UI\n            };\n        }\n\n        function draw() {\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n            const centerY = height / 2;\n            const centerX = width / 2;\n            const cardLeft = centerX - 160; // Half of w-[320px]\n            const cardRight = centerX + 160;\n\n            // 1. Draw Network Grid (Right Side)\n            ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03)';\n            const gridSpacing = 20;\n            const gridStartX = cardRight + 30;\n\n            for (let x = gridStartX; x < width; x += gridSpacing) {\n                for (let y = centerY - 150; y < centerY + 150; y += gridSpacing) {\n                    const opacity = Math.max(0, 1 - ((x - gridStartX) / (width - gridStartX)));\n                    if (opacity > 0) {\n                        ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(16, 185, 129, ${opacity * 0.1})`; // Emerald tint grid\n                        ctx.fillRect(x, y, 2, 2);\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            // 2. Draw Outbound API Connections (Card to Nodes)\n            ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)';\n            ctx.lineWidth = 1.5;\n\n            // Connect to ERP Sync\n            ctx.beginPath();\n            ctx.moveTo(cardRight, centerY - 80);\n            ctx.lineTo(centerX + 220, centerY - 80);\n            ctx.stroke();\n\n            // Connect to Treasury\n            ctx.beginPath();\n            ctx.moveTo(cardRight, centerY);\n            ctx.lineTo(centerX + 260, centerY);\n            ctx.stroke();\n\n            // Connect to Tax Auth\n            ctx.beginPath();\n            ctx.moveTo(cardRight, centerY + 80);\n            ctx.lineTo(centerX + 200, centerY + 80);\n            ctx.stroke();\n\n            // Draw pulses along the static lines\n            const time = Date.now() / 1000;\n            ctx.fillStyle = '#10b981';\n            const pulseDist1 = (time * 100) % (220 - 160);\n            const pulseDist2 = (time * 120) % (260 - 160);\n            const pulseDist3 = (time * 80) % (200 - 160);\n\n            ctx.fillRect(cardRight + pulseDist1, centerY - 81, 4, 3);\n            ctx.fillRect(cardRight + pulseDist2, centerY - 1, 4, 3);\n            ctx.fillRect(cardRight + pulseDist3, centerY + 79, 4, 3);\n\n            // 3. Draw Inbound Transaction Streams (Left Side)\n            ctx.lineCap = 'round';\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < lines.length; i++) {\n                const line = lines[i];\n                const yPos = centerY + line.offsetY;\n\n                // Opacity fades in as it enters, fades out near the card\n                const distToCard = cardLeft - (line.x + line.length);\n                let alpha = 1;\n                if (distToCard < 100) {\n                    alpha = Math.max(0, distToCard / 100);\n                } else if (line.x < -100) {\n                    alpha = Math.max(0, (line.x + 200) / 100);\n                }\n\n                ctx.globalAlpha = alpha;\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.moveTo(line.x, yPos);\n\n                const endX = Math.min(line.x + line.length, cardLeft);\n\n                if (line.x < cardLeft) {\n                    ctx.lineTo(endX, yPos);\n                    ctx.strokeStyle = line.color;\n                    ctx.lineWidth = line.thickness;\n                    ctx.stroke();\n\n                    // Leading point glow\n                    if (line.color === '#10b981' || line.color === '#34d399') {\n                        ctx.fillStyle = '#fff';\n                        ctx.beginPath();\n                        ctx.arc(endX, yPos, line.thickness, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                        ctx.fill();\n                    }\n                }\n                ctx.globalAlpha = 1;\n\n                // Move line\n                line.x += line.speed;\n\n                // Reset\n                if (line.x > cardLeft) {\n                    lines[i] = createLine();\n                }\n            }\n\n            requestAnimationFrame(draw);\n        }\n\n        draw();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "axiom-financial-infrastructure.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/axiom-financial-infrastructure.jpg", "source_name": "axiom-financial-infrastructure-DESIGN.md", "views": 66, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-30T11:24:37.062792+00:00"}